---
import EvidenceRail from '../components/sbla-012/EvidenceRail.astro';
import AtlasLayout from '../layouts/AtlasLayout.astro';
---

<AtlasLayout
  title="Science-Based Lifting Atlas"
  description="Evidence-first resistance training anatomy — a visual evidence graph."
  current="home"
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <p class="kicker">Anatomy · mechanics · evidence</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">Strength, mapped to evidence.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        Explore how a structure moves, how exercises load it, and what the
        available research can—and cannot—support.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#journeys">Explore the slice</a>
        <a class="button button--quiet" href="./methodology/">Read the method</a
        >
      </div>
      <dl class="hero__ledger" aria-label="Current evidence-system status">
        <div><dt>Reviewed claims</dt><dd>23</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Linked sources</dt><dd>68</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Public claims</dt><dd>0</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="atlas-plate" aria-label="Abstract anatomical torso plate">
      <p class="atlas-plate__label">Plate 01 / anterior torso</p>
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 520 680"
        role="img"
        aria-labelledby="plate-title plate-desc"
      >
        <title id="plate-title">Abstract anterior torso study</title>
        <desc id="plate-desc">
          A restrained line drawing marks the chest region as the first atlas
          focus. It is decorative and does not convey anatomical detail.
        </desc>
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="torso-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#182c36"></stop>
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0b151c"></stop>
          </linearGradient>
          <radialGradient id="focus-fill">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#e18476" stop-opacity=".78"></stop>
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d86f61" stop-opacity=".14"></stop>
          </radialGradient>
        </defs>
        <path
          class="atlas-plate__body"
          d="M214 35c-28 10-46 36-47 69-1 28 10 51 27 65-13 25-35 39-77 57-37 15-57 51-61 104l-13 206c-3 53 23 89 70 108 45 19 92 24 147 24s102-5 147-24c47-19 73-55 70-108l-13-206c-4-53-24-89-61-104-42-18-64-32-77-57 17-14 28-37 27-65-1-33-19-59-47-69-27-10-65-10-92 0Z"
        ></path>
        <path class="atlas-plate__sternum" d="M260 175v277"></path>
        <path class="atlas-plate__rib" d="M260 205c-62-22-117-6-153 39"></path>
        <path class="atlas-plate__rib" d="M260 205c62-22 117-6 153 39"></path>
        <path
          class="atlas-plate__focus"
          d="M249 208c-56-31-116-12-142 36 30 70 77 92 142 70Z"></path>
        <path
          class="atlas-plate__focus"
          d="M271 208c56-31 116-12 142 36-30 70-77 92-142 70Z"></path>
        <circle class="atlas-plate__node" cx="384" cy="250" r="5"></circle>
        <path class="atlas-plate__leader" d="M389 250h79"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="atlas-plate__annotation" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Pectoral region</span>
        <strong>First review slice</strong>
      </div>
      <p class="atlas-plate__gate">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Scientific content remains locked pending owner approval.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="journeys" class="journeys" aria-labelledby="journeys-title">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--compact">
      <p class="kicker">One question, several routes</p>
      <h2 id="journeys-title">Enter where your decision begins.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="journey-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01 / Structure</span>
        <h3>Start with anatomy</h3>
        <p>
          Move from a trainable structure to function, exercises, and the claims
          behind both.
        </p>
        <strong>Preview locked</strong>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02 / Exercise</span>
        <h3>Start with a lift</h3>
        <p>
          Inspect mechanics, scope, related structures, uncertainty, and direct
          source trails.
        </p>
        <strong>Preview locked</strong>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03 / Evidence</span>
        <h3>Start with a source</h3>
        <p>
          See the study record, its limitations, and every project claim that
          relies on it.
        </p>
        <a href="./methodology/"
          >How review works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
        >
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EvidenceRail />
</AtlasLayout>
